{"additions":2,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Release v0.8.0\n\n## Changes since v0.7.0\n- ♻️ GitHub view: workflow runs as a third column (jobs tree + log in the detail); the standalone Actions page is removed and Worktrees moves to key `6` (#118, #124)\n- ♻️ Projects view: only projects linked to the repository, board shown full width (`p` / `P` to switch, the list pane stays available via a custom layout); layouts may leave panes unplaced (#128, #129)\n- ✨ Procs view: btop-style CPU / memory history area charts with load colors, per-core grid (`c`), per-process history in the detail (#127, #130)\n- 🐛 Focus falls back to a placed pane when a user layout unplaces the default one; GitHub detail sub-panes cycle with `Tab` correctly\n- 📝 All demo GIFs re-recorded; Worktrees tape key fixed (#126)\n\nConfig compatibility: `pages \"actions\"` / `page:actions` now fail fast with a message pointing at the GitHub page.\n\nMerging this PR triggers the release workflow (tag → GitHub Release → crates.io publish → binaries → Homebrew formula).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","changedFiles":2,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-31T04:54:08Z","deletions":2,"headRefName":"release/0.8.0","labels":[],"number":133,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLcqZ-A","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe change is a straightforward, consistent version bump in the manifest and lockfile with no additional logic changes.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nBumps the crate version to **v0.8.0** to cut the v0.8.0 release of `vig` (the Git TUI viewer), aligning the manifest and lockfile for publishing/tagging.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Update `Cargo.toml` package version from `0.7.0` → `0.8.0`.\n- Update the `vig` entry in `Cargo.lock` from `0.7.0` → `0.8.0`.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| Cargo.toml | Updates the package version to 0.8.0 for the release. |\r\n| Cargo.lock | Keeps the lockfile’s `vig` package version in sync with the manifest. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 1/2 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-08-31T04:55:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"32f13982208450c4f43ff24945ff70991cb11fad"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-31T04:58:19Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33358669465/job/99385619353","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-08-31T04:54:14Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-31T04:54:46Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33358669460/job/99385619166","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-08-31T04:54:14Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-31T05:05:25Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33359265538/job/99387324022","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-08-31T05:05:16Z",